  "notes": [
    "Fully regular reflexive -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *encorvado*",
    "*encorvarse* = to hunch over, to stoop (*No te encorves al sentarte* — Don't hunch when you sit)",
    "Non-reflexive *encorvar* = to bend/curve something (*El peso encorva la estantería* — The weight bends the shelf)",
    "*estar encorvado/a* = to be hunched over (state)",
    "Related: *la joroba* = hump; *jorobado/a* = hunchbacked; *la postura* = posture"
  ],
